  "prefLabel": "He-A 707.02 Services Prohibited",
  "priorExpiration": "2006-11-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 707.02 Services Prohibited. Each IDIP and WIDIP shall offer only intervention and educational services for its clients convicted of DWI. Providers shall not offer treatment services for the alcohol and drug problems of said clients within the context of the IDIP or WIDIP.\n\nSource. #6653, EMERGENCY, eff 12-12-97, EXPIRED 4-11-98\n\nNew. #6753, eff 5-20-98; ss by #8624, INTERIM, eff 5-20-06, EXPIRES: 11-16-06; ss by #8749, eff 11-16-06",
